OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight road closures for tree
OL,4,Aremoval work
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a busy road is to close for
OL,7,Ffive nights to allow trees and
OL,8,Fvegetation to be cleared as part of a
OL,9,Fscheme to widen a key junction near
OL,10,FEast Bridgford.
OL,12,FThe A6097 will be shut between
OL,13,FGunthorpe Bridge and the A46 every
OL,14,Fnight from Monday until Saturday
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,17,FNottinghamshire County Council said
OL,18,Fdrivers would be diverted via the A46,
OL,19,FA617, A614 and A6097 during the
OL,20,Fclosures.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
