OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight road closures for tree
OL,4,Aremoval work
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Kirk Hill junction is set to be
OL,7,Fwidened, with an extra lane added in
OL,8,Feach direction, as part of a major
OL,9,Fscheme of improvements along the A614
OL,10,Fand A6097.
